        "content": "## Ashby \u2192 onboard-sync\nTrigger only: no business logic lives in n8n.\n\nThe body is serialized ONCE (Code node), signed, and sent byte-for-byte (raw body). If you let the HTTP node re-serialize JSON, the server's HMAC check fails.",
